Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to reconvene\Nwith Malone in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyacho, I'm leaving this\Njob to you and Malone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's better to have the both\Nof you on this job, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work to piece together\Nthe clues back on this end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer will\Nthis take? Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to\Nreconstruct it, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rizzolto, you do know there are consequences\Nfor going against Passione, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I'm short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left eye will be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do your job is\Nyour right arm and right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know better\Nthan anyone how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss makes all traitors\Ndisappear from the face of...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The hand you just severed has already\Nchanged itself into another organism,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,one that's ready to devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed it, it's now a piranha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That attack totally ripped this\Nbastard open from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he still moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak to me, baby head.\NSay something. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That dirty turtle shit\Nis all over my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve this kind of\Ntorture and humiliation, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm gonna be scarred for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay dearly for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die like a pathetic mutt\Nin a shit pool of your own shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna say this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to take you out in order\Nto heal Bucciarati and Trish,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,then that's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll aim for that ugly head of yours next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And perish, you dickhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. All the remote tracking\Nis great until Daddy's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,little death machine\Ndecides to go off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've attacked me three times\Nnow, and I see right through you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's range got even longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby's growing up quite fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His temper and growth\Nare connected together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, di molto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The shrew turned out to be the\Nstand mother of the freaking year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm snuffing out this big talking\Nprick, and I'll do it any way I please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverse course now, golden\Nwind! Now dive! Let's dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Try using your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fist didn't come\Nanywhere near my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I win, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All this struggling, it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:04:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you really thought Golden\NWind was playing fetch with his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned the bike into a hand and\Nhad it delivered right here to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you noticed, but you just\Nassimilated that machine into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those third-rate tricks,\Nthey won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just split apart and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bikes need tanks of gasoline to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a simple task to\Nlight you up before the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,thought of running away\Neven crossed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,On fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess doing things as you pleased\Ndidn't really work out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:06:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my way. What he's gone, I've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,lost contact with him there's no way I!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Refuse to believe it damn that rookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone had the goals to take my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's Malone's bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to catch these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave no stone unturned and\Nthink outside the box, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I get leaving no stone unturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idiot would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who hasn't turned\Nover rocks to find stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is thinking outside\Nthe box even supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I think better in there. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So my brains in a box now That's\Nthe dumbest thing I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm an idiot capsule
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Malone Bucciarati and\Nhis crew are in the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I hear you don't go\Ncounting me out just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I still possess Bucciarati's lifeblood.\NMass-producing juniors will be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll hunt him down in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're right about that, Malone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This new guy is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to dispose of him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find us a truly\Nwicked surrogate who will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,give birth to a powerful\Nand vicious beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A beast that will be starving for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the hell? A snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I losing it? What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's a snake in Reimi Termini?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be that annoying newbie's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have used Junior's corpse to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Melode, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The venomous snake I left at the\Nterminal just went back to being junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this user's\Ndefeat, five are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If our info is correct, only two\Nmembers of the Hitman team remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there's no time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hail to Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They got Malone too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've analyzed you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending my findings over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a new directive from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Abokyo, I'd like you to\Ntake a look at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A bakyo is to activate Moody Jazz by the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,chair and rewind time\Nby more than 14 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means that someone must have been\Nresiding here before we came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's what this is implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's so, then let's see\Nwhere 15 hours back takes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A form is appearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, haven't we\Nseen this old guy before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore Pericolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So it must have been he who placed the\Nturtle by the fountain at Napoli Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:10:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And about 14 hours ago, he was\Nstanding where we are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Resuming playback.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully, Ragazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relaying the specifics\Nof your final mission. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Final mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Strict confidentiality requires me to\Nadopt this bizarre mode of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Under no circumstances are you\Nto share any of the following,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,as you will now learn the way that\NTrish has to be delivered to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A special way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For us to deliver Trish, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When you arrive in Venice, you\Nare to proceed to this sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, you will find\Nand obtain the OA disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It contains specifics concerning\Nthe location of the handover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbacchio, pause the playback. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the gateway to the City\Nof Water, Santa Lucia Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See the lion statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to obtain the OA disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, the enemy is\Naware of my influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So the way in which you deliver,\NTrish, is absolutely critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Discretion's our most powerful ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a shred of evidence\Ncan be left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived a full life thanks to\Nthe boss's innumerable blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was replete with adventures\Nmost can only dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My mission is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be safe, Ragazzi, and may\Nmy prayers reach his ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pericolo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they've received\Nthe directive by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You must obtain the disc, lest our\Nmeeting be met with extreme difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fate rides on that final moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Trish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring my daughter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.60,0:12:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Floating in the ethereal dawn\Nlies the fortress city, Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one road connects the Italian\Nmainland with the island's center.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ponte della Libertà, which stretches\Nthree kilometers over a shallow lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond it sits the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Venetian Lion, which houses the\Nmysterious disk, can be found there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, looks like we're in the\Nclear, at least for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Same thing up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The city is still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones on the road. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do these windows keep fogging up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the tires are\Nskidding a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On a road as straight as this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, who taught you to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you even have a license?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 15, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something stuck to the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on looking\Nout, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing looks like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's crack the windows a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The condensation is being caused\Nby the difference in temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What is with this wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The thought of losing that\Nchilled me to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, once we did some\Ncomputer analysis on the ashes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Piecing together the photo Pericolo\Nburned was surprisingly easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What an idiotic move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you fools really think you had\Nwhat it took to escape the hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Start firing through the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn car, it's like it's\Nbeing cryogenically frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold my whole body's numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My little finger got ripped clean off,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and I didn't notice it sticking\Nto the window like a frozen fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I can't peel myself off,\Nmy brain will get frozen over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But do I really want to\Nlive life with half a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing a reptile anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you aren't traveling\Nwith Trish and Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be pretty important\Nto risk separating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been given a special\Nassignment to retrieve something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The place in the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's at Santa Lucia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm actually bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He covered himself in ice and\Nstuck himself to the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets are freezing\Nbefore getting to the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us are starting to freeze too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just blinked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my eyelashes are\Nstuck! Damn it to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy was just lying in wait\Nfor a chance to jump on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're traveling 80 kilometers\Nan hour right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:16:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning that the wind is blowing around us\Nat approximately 20 kilometers a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and the wind chill factor drops one degree\NCelsius for every meter of wind speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In layman's terms, we're all freezing\Nto death at minus 20 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or were you planning on hitting the\Nbrakes after we freeze to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's funny you\Nshould mention the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The stupid pedal is frozen\Nsolid and won't fudge an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The steering wheel's useless,\Nbut the engine's humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so at least we're good there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The car's exterior has dropped to\Nminus 100 degrees. It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so fast this has got to be the\Nenemy's stand the blood from
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,my separate finger is frozen it's\Nas hard as a rock hey journal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the moisture from my breath is\Nmaking my damn nostrils freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my lips. Oh,\Nshit. I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, turn the damn thing into\Na freaking frog if you gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I already tried that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem is, nothing can survive\Nat minus 100 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the capital of France,\Nbut English speakers pronounce it Paris,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,while most say Paris the\Nway it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow Venice has replaced the\Nreal Venice as the global standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Like those stories, The Merchant\Nof Venice and Death in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the damn book Death in Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn a little Italian, puttana, and\Ncall the thing what it's supposed to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of puppet\Nbullshit are they on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So the cold is finally starting\Nto affect your driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about golden wind, Mista,\Nbut I can't use it without warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about all this, but\Nthere's not much I can do at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides picking up bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've about reached your limit\Nas far as blowing holes in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll put your body\Ninto an even deeper freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets retain a little heat\Nafter being fired, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I fire the ones Giorno picked\Nup, then I'm packing literal heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of him, he's at a loss for words,\Nso I'll do him a solid just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of this freak, golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the sprouts don't look like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but those little plant\Nroots are strong enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,tear up asphalt and demolish\Nboulders into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to the wheel, Torno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Malone said, the newbie\Nmust have pulled this stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't get off that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break. Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll swoop in and make off with the goods\Nbefore those fools even know what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,White Ice's specialty\Nis freezing the moisture
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,in the air at extremely low temperatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I create my shimmering armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great for skating\Non almost any surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And an added benefit is the way\Nit stops your pesky bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastor Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't go any faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The tires are slipping all over the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, these guys know all\Nabout what's waiting at the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but they still don't have the clues\Nto where Trish and the turtle are,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,which, if you ask me, is a\Npretty damn good silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's that trademark optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet again, you're a special one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:19:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we can't, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just lose speed if we start\Nsliding around the road again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers two and three, get\Nover here on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you like asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're about to get intimately\Nacquainted with the taste of it real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost Freaky the Snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The station's just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll grab the disk as planned and\Nhide before he catches up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice plan, but keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never make it to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I have my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing moisture\Nfrom the exhaust pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how cold does it have to\Nbe for that shit to freeze over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:21:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, here's another dose of hot light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He just popped open the trunk,\Nwhich means he's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got unwanted cargo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That maniac is gonna try\Nfreezing the brakes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stop wasting your\Nbreath, you gun-bondling kagakatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how Trish is absent, I\Ncan now do what I came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, your stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It only cracked?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it going to take to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I dissolve his armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, could you stand\Naway from this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! Not just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we're going in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes,\NI wake up feeling so horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind,\Nsince you'll be all I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.54,0:22:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.40,0:23:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must not get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
